# t2-visualize-desktop: the removed terminal bridge's host extra (the lead applies these; contract-ipc.ts and
# renderer/core-direct/install.ts are already edited in the task commit)

main no longer sends DESKTOP_IPC.terminalRunRequested and the task removed that channel name from
src/shared/contract-ipc.ts; the window's own core link receives ui/openRequested{kind: terminal}
(renderer/core-direct/api-terminal.ts, tested in api-terminal.test.mjs; the core publishes it to renderer
windows in mixdog-core-session terminal_host.rs, tested there). Until these three edits are applied,
tsc of the preload fails on DESKTOP_IPC.terminalRunRequested.

1. src/preload/host-api.ts, in createHostApi's returned object: delete the line
     onHostTerminalRunRequested: (listener) => subscribeIpc(DESKTOP_IPC.terminalRunRequested, listener),
   (and subscribeIpc from the destructured deps if nothing else in the file uses it).
2. src/shared/desktop-api-split.ts, interface DesktopHostExtras: delete onHostTerminalRunRequested and the
   doc comment above it ("The reveals main's own agent `terminal` bridge asks for ...").
3. src/preload/host-api.test.mjs: delete 'onHostTerminalRunRequested' from EXTRAS.
